{%- comment -%}
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. One item = question | answer
  Put @@ on its own line between items. Add as many items as you like.
  Do not use | or a straight apostrophe (') inside the text (use &#39; instead).
  To split an answer into paragraphs write: first paragraph</p><p>second paragraph
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_heading = 'Frequently Asked Questions' -%}
{%- capture mb_data -%}
I tried berberine before and felt nothing. Why would this be different? | Plain berberine has an absorption problem most supplement brands never mention. Your gut lining contains proteins that act like bouncers, blocking most berberine before it ever reaches your bloodstream. Without black pepper extract, studies suggest less than 1% actually absorbs. Purge Berberine includes piperine from black pepper extract, which disables those bouncers and increases absorption by up to 20 times. That is why women who felt nothing on plain berberine notice a difference here.
@@
Why four ingredients? Why not just berberine? | When estrogen drops, four separate metabolic systems break down at once. Berberine addresses the insulin lock, but it does nothing for the blood sugar spikes, cellular energy uptake, or hormonal inflammation the other three locks control. Ceylon cinnamon, chromium, and turmeric each have a specific job for the remaining three. One ingredient was never going to be enough because the problem was never just one lock.
@@
When will I start to notice something? | Most women describe the first shift in week one or two, usually as quieter afternoon cravings or steadier energy through the day. By weeks three and four, the belly typically starts to ease as the blood sugar lock comes online. The changes women notice most — the stubborn lower belly, clothes fitting differently — tend to come in weeks five and six. Consistency matters more than anything else.
@@
How do I take it? | Two capsules once daily, with a meal. No timing protocol, no cycling, no restrictive diet required. Take it consistently and let all four ingredients do their work.
@@
What is your return policy? | We offer a 60-day money-back guarantee. If Purge Berberine does not feel like a worthwhile addition to your routine within 60 days of purchase, contact our support team and we will process a full refund. No complicated process.
@@
Is this safe to take alongside other supplements or medication? | The four ingredients in Purge Berberine are natural and well-tolerated by most women. If you are currently on medication, particularly for blood sugar or blood pressure, we recommend speaking with your doctor before starting. We are not able to provide personalised medical advice.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mb_items = mb_data | split: '@@' -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"></noscript>

<style>
.page-width:has(>.mb-faq){max-width:none;padding:0}
.mb-faq{padding:40px 0;background:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.6px;color:rgba(18,18,18,.75);content-visibility:auto;contain-intrinsic-size:auto 560px}
.mb-faq__wrap{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 12px}
.mb-faq__head{margin-bottom:36px;text-align:center}
.mb-faq__h{margin:0;padding:0;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:0;word-break:break-word;color:#2b2118}
.mb-faq__list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0}
.mb-faq__item{border-bottom:1px solid #ede0d4}
.mb-faq__item:first-child{border-top:1px solid #ede0d4}
.mb-faq__q{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;width:100%;padding:18px 0;border:none;background:none;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;color:#2b2118;cursor:pointer;transition:color .2s}
.mb-faq__q:hover,.mb-faq__q[aria-expanded="true"]{color:#c47245}
.mb-faq__qt{flex:1}
.mb-faq__i{display:flex;flex-shrink:0;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:20px;height:20px;font-size:20px;line-height:1;color:#c47245;transition:transform .25s ease,color .2s}
.mb-faq__q[aria-expanded="true"] .mb-faq__i{color:#2b2118;transform:rotate(45deg)}
.mb-faq__a{overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height 300ms ease}
.mb-faq__ai{padding-bottom:20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#5c4b3a}
.mb-faq__ai p{margin:0}
.mb-faq__ai p+p{margin-top:12px}
@media screen and (min-width:750px){
.mb-faq{padding:48px 0 64px}
.mb-faq__wrap{padding:0 50px}
.mb-faq__head{margin-bottom:44px}
.mb-faq__h{font-size:32px}
.mb-faq__q{padding:22px 0;font-size:18px}
.mb-faq__i{width:22px;height:22px;font-size:22px}
.mb-faq__ai{padding-bottom:24px;font-size:16px}
}
</style>

<section class="mb-faq" aria-label="{{ mb_heading | strip_html | escape }}"><div class="mb-faq__wrap">
<div class="mb-faq__head"><h2 class="mb-faq__h">{{ mb_heading }}</h2></div>
<div class="mb-faq__list">
{%- for it in mb_items -%}
{%- assign f = it | split: '|' -%}
<div class="mb-faq__item"><button type="button" class="mb-faq__q" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mb-faq-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><span class="mb-faq__qt">{{ f[0] | strip }}</span><span class="mb-faq__i" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="mb-faq__a" id="mb-faq-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><div class="mb-faq__ai"><p>{{ f[1] | strip }}</p></div></div></div>
{%- endfor -%}
</div>
</div></section>

<script>
(function(){
var r=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling,cur=null,raf=0;
if(!r||!r.classList.contains('mb-faq'))return;
function fit(b){var a=b.nextElementSibling;a.style.maxHeight=a.scrollHeight+'px'}
function open(b){b.setAttribute('aria-expanded','true');fit(b);cur=b}
function shut(b){b.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');b.nextElementSibling.style.maxHeight='0';if(cur===b)cur=null}
r.addEventListener('click',function(e){
var b=e.target.closest('.mb-faq__q'),was;
if(!b)return;
was=b===cur;
if(cur&&!was)shut(cur);
if(was)shut(b);else open(b);
});
addEventListener('resize',function(){
if(cur&&!raf)raf=requestAnimationFrame(function(){raf=0;if(cur)fit(cur)});
},{passive:true});
})();
</script>
